#* {{quote-book|en|editor=Patricia Unterman|title=Best Restaurants of San Francisco: The San Francisco Chronicle Guide to Fine Dining|location=San Francisco, Calif.|publisher=w:Chronicle Books|year=1991|page=275|pageurl=https://archive.org/details/bestrestaurantso00unte/page/275/mode/1up|isbn=0-8118-0065-2|passage=They include fresh noodles, roasted chickens, savory Italian '''tortas''', ''caponata'' and other antipasti like roasted onions in balsamic vinegar, crusty walnut breads, biscotti, and fabulous Italian desserts.}}
